top-sort [col0 asc, sm_type asc, web_name asc] limit 100
└─ project (col0, sm_type, web_name, 30 days, 31-60 days, 61-90 days, 91-120 days, >120 days) (rows≈1 cost≈18K)
   └─ aggregate keys=[gb_0, ship_mode.sm_type, web_site.web_name] aggs=[sum_0=sum, sum_1=sum, sum_2=sum, sum_3=sum, sum_4=sum] (rows≈1 cost≈17.9K)
      └─ project (gb_0, ship_mode.sm_type, web_site.web_name, arg_0, arg_1, arg_2, arg_3, arg_4) (rows≈1 cost≈17.8K)
         └─ join inner [web_sales.ws_warehouse_sk = warehouse.w_warehouse_sk] emit-filter 1 from left (rows≈1 cost≈17.8K)
            ├─ join inner [web_sales.ws_ship_mode_sk = ship_mode.sm_ship_mode_sk] emit-filter 2 from left (rows≈1 cost≈13.3K)
            │  ├─ join inner [web_sales.ws_web_site_sk = web_site.web_site_sk] emit-filter 3 from left (rows≈1 cost≈8.9K)
            │  │  ├─ join inner [date_dim.d_date_sk = web_sales.ws_ship_date_sk] (rows≈1 cost≈4.5K)
            │  │  │  ├─ filter (&& (<= 1212 |date_dim.d_month_seq|) (<= |date_dim.d_month_seq| (+ 1212 11))) (rows≈2 cost≈160)
            │  │  │  │  └─ source date_dim AS date_dim row-groups (&& (<= 1212 |date_dim.d_month_seq|) (<= |date_dim.d_month_seq| (+ 1212 11))) (rows≈10 cost≈80)
            │  │  │  └─ source web_sales AS web_sales (rows≈10 cost≈200)
            │  │  └─ source web_site AS web_site use-filter 3 keys=[web_site.web_site_sk] (rows≈10 cost≈200)
            │  └─ source ship_mode AS ship_mode use-filter 2 keys=[ship_mode.sm_ship_mode_sk] (rows≈10 cost≈200)
            └─ source warehouse AS warehouse use-filter 1 keys=[warehouse.w_warehouse_sk] (rows≈10 cost≈200)
